<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .form-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .form-field-container {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    padding-top: 5px;
  }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo -->
    <div style="width: 100px; height: 100px; margin: 0 auto 20px;"></div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">APPLICATION FOR ADMISSION</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt;">into the <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span> at <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Thank you for your interest in the <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span>, a joint program of <span data-field="service_name_1">{{ service_name_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>. We are excited to review your application.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Please remember that admissions to the program are competitive, and not everyone who applies will be accepted into the program.</p>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Do your best to complete the application by yourself; if you need help filling out the application, please make sure the answers are still your own.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">In addition to the completed application, we will also need:</h3>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>A copy of your high school transcript if you have one</li>
    <li>Your most recent Individualized Education Plan (IEP)</li>
    <li>Your most recent psychological evaluation</li>
    <li>The contact information of 2 (two) individuals who are familiar with your abilities and who can serve as references for you</li>
    <li>An MCE Skills Assessment Form, completed by a parent or guardian</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Upon receiving the application, our staff will review your documentation and contact your references. If we feel you are appropriate for the program, we will then call you to schedule an admissions interview. After the interview, you will receive a letter letting you know if we were able to accept you into the program.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Please provide all supporting documentation and submit the application to:</p>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <p><span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>, <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span> <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Try to be as honest and independent as you can when you complete the application. We look forward to hearing from you!</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-header">SECTION ONE: STUDENT INFORMATION</h2>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Anticipated year of enrollment (All students start in the fall)</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="anticipated_enrollment_year">{{ anticipated_enrollment_year }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Date of birth</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Name</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Address</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Home phone number</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="home_phone_number">{{ home_phone_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Cell phone number</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="cell_phone_number">{{ cell_phone_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Email address</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Social Security number</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="ssn">{{ ssn }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Medicaid number</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="medicaid_number">{{ medicaid_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div></div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-header">SECTION TWO: PARENT/GUARDIAN INFORMATION</h2>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Name</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian.name">{{ parent_guardian.name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Cell phone number</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian.cell_phone_number">{{ parent_guardian.cell_phone_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Email address</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian.email_address">{{ parent_guardian.email_address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Occupation</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian.occupation">{{ parent_guardian.occupation }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Name</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian_2.name">{{ parent_guardian_2.name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Cell phone number</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian_2.cell_phone_number">{{ parent_guardian_2.cell_phone_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Email address</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian_2.email_address">{{ parent_guardian_2.email_address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Occupation</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="parent_guardian_2.occupation">{{ parent_guardian_2.occupation }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-header">SECTION THREE: SCHOOL AND WORK INFORMATION</h2>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Name of high school</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="high_school.name">{{ high_school.name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Year of graduation</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="high_school.graduation_year">{{ high_school.graduation_year }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Address of high school</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="high_school.address">{{ high_school.address }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">What type of services did you receive in high school?</label>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Self-Contained Classes</label>
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Resource Room</label>
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Consultant Teacher</label>
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Counseling</label>
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Inclusion Classes</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">Speech Therapy</label>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Occupational Therapy (OT)</label>
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Physical Therapy (PT)</label>
        <label style="font-weight: normal;">Other</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">What was your favorite subject?</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="favorite_subject">{{ favorite_subject }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">What was your least favorite subject?</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="least_favorite_subject">{{ least_favorite_subject }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">What areas are you interested in learning more about?</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="areas_of_interest">{{ areas_of_interest }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <label class="form-label">What activities were you involved with in and out of school?</label>
      <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="activities_involved">{{ activities_involved }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">If you have attended any school or program after high school, please fill out information below.</h3>

  {% for i in range(1) %}
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">Name of school/program</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].name">{{ post_secondary_education[i].name }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1; text-align: right;">
        <label class="form-label">Dates: From</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].dates_from">{{ post_secondary_education[i].dates_from }}</span></div>
        <label class="form-label">To</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].dates_to">{{ post_secondary_education[i].dates_to }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">City</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].city">{{ post_secondary_education[i].city }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">State</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].state">{{ post_secondary_education[i].state }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">Did you ever have a job? If so, where?</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].had_job">{{ post_secondary_education[i].had_job }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">What were your responsibilities?</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="post_secondary_education[{{ i }}].responsibilities">{{ post_secondary_education[i].responsibilities }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-header">SECTION FOUR: REFERENCES</h2>
  <p>Please provide the name of 2 (two) people not related to you that we can contact to provide references for your admission into the <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span>.</p>

  {% for i in range(2) %}
  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">Name</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="reference[{{ i }}].name">{{ reference[i].name }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">Relationship</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="reference[{{ i }}].relationship">{{ reference[i].relationship }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <label class="form-label">Phone number</label>
        <div class="form-field-container"><span data-field="reference[{{ i }}].phone_number">{{ reference[i].phone_number }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1;">
        <!-- Placeholder for second contact info if needed, otherwise empty -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <h2 class="section-header">SECTION FIVE: ESSAY</h2>
  <p>In one or two paragraphs, answer the following question:</p>
  <p style="font-weight: bold;">Why do you want to attend the <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span> at <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>?</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px;">
    <div style="height: 200px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="at">{{ at }}</div>
    <div style="height: 200px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;" data-field="at_2">{{ at_2 }}</div>
  </div>
</div>